": "2501291936789025", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12331303_245598725994458_479181173273133056_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IdHUBTqgkD8Q7kNvwHj8-EX&_nc_oc=AdqKtxQ6iBmy6OnbZQkv9aAtQt4s-6GdPnQlFK-hiNjy6sXk4BZFv7m-aJh5B3cHWak&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4xDw69gloONA-5Rk1XaMZq5KpyrjOwEOtqKDEnDsx4rg&oe=6A11CAFD"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "642658059801509", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139433_425044671239926_4609888145117282304_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Dh8kWz9H4qEQ7kNvwHN8H7J&_nc_oc=AdpBV2iIa5DN_RDIxv-YdSyJiXQvMFC5IIHHHoZLLUh909rguY2xaAzb8q93v_97Ec8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6XyFtfyjN54nsRGlihYR3V-dTCmbhTd1Nh9sIllYbluA&oe=6A11B13B"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "619740281913536", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139467_430682997415049_6349888944162734080_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fNzB9_nAk2MQ7kNvwH0X-fL&_nc_oc=AdosbAVGA8uUab2hyztnTPpsrkTy4AYmI4jx-nZa50JRdR8egsp3-nuGjr45_cDilI0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4N0iBrebUnfYOTzcT1OXGmXn4UEG-kdBEz7S2Xc5DVRA&oe=6A11C665"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RotatorX", "keywords": ["Arcade", "Endlessrunner", "SciFi", "Speed", "Fast"], "long_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a dark unique sci-fi atmosphere. Fast paced and addictive - but also meditative. The intuitive controls makes it easy to play - but it's hard to gain. Speed, procedural level design, dynamic lighting FX and an adaptive soundtrack will guarantee a challenging and immersive VR experience.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n* Dynamic lighting FX\n* Adaptive soundtrack\n* Intuitve controls\n* Procedural level design\n\n! Oculus Go only !", "short_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade g